   1659  fa6b							; AddScore — add BCD amount in A (e.g. #$50, #$75) to HUD score.
   1660  fa6b							; ScoreTh/ScoreHu = binary 0-9; ScoreTe = packed BCD. Clobbers A.
   1661  fa6b							; Real 6502 BCD add — SED/ADC/CLD straight-line: D is cleared before any
   1662  fa6b							; jsr, the 2600 has no interrupts, and nothing here restores D via plp
   1663  fa6b							; (the 2026-09-23 decimal-mode rule). The old BINARY `cmp #$A0 / sbc #$A0`
   1664  fa6b							; fix-up missed nibble-level overflow: $25+$75 = $9A stored raw -> ones
   1665  fa6b							; digit A -> glyph index 10 -> DigitGfx+80 (past the 10-glyph font) =
   1666  fa6b							; the solid-block score digit (screenshots/score_issue_002.png).
   1667  fa6b							; C=1 = BCD carry (sum >= 100) -> ScoreHu path.
   1668  fa6b							; SIZE PIN: routine runs $FA7D..$FAA4 exactly (UpdateLaserSound's pad
   1669  fa6b							; target is $FAA5). Old head = clc/adc/cmp/bcc/sbc = 9 bytes, new head =
   1670  fa6b							; sed/clc/adc/cld/bcc = 7, so the two nops restore the exact length —
   1671  fa6b							; without them every pad below shifts silently.
   1672  fa6b				   AddScore
   1673  fa6b		       f8		      sed
   1674  fa6c		       18		      clc
   1675  fa6d		       65 f5		      adc	ScoreTe
   1676  fa6f		       d8		      cld
   1677  fa70		       90 1c		      bcc	.ASstoreTe
