   2519  ff0f							; Tally entry tramp slice ($FFE6-$FFEB) — byte-identical with kernel.asm's
   2520  ff0f							; copy at the same address (F6 pad rule). bank0 executes `sta $1FF7` at
   2521  ff0f							; $FFE6-$FFE8; the fetch at $FFE9 comes from THIS bank = `jmp TallyEntry`
   2522  ff0f							; ($F44F — moved here from bank2, repack chunk 3, 2026-10-20). Neither bank
   2523  ff0f							; runs its other half. $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (hotspot mirrors).
   2524  ff0f							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2525  ff0f		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$FFE6 - *, 0
   2526  ffe6				   TallyTramp_b1
